<title>FRANCE: France plans to privatise GAN, CIC in 97.</title>
<headline>France plans to privatise GAN, CIC in 97.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Thursday the government planned to privatise state-controlled insurer and its banking unit Credit Industriel et Commercial (CIC) this year.</p>
<p>Asked at a news conference about plans to sell off the two companies, Arthuis replied the disposals should take place &quot;during the course of 1997&quot;.</p>
<p>Earlier, he had said that CIC and GAN could be privatised either &quot;together or separately&quot;.</p>
</text>
